384ee3-f58c-4649-b97c-df50bad74276" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Redemísti nos. p. 1729.</l><l xml:id="m-91d7df1e-5559-4214-bfe2-721d7079e8d4" facs="#m-640bdc46-f44e-4fa7-8cbc-873788321397" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-dfaa9c5e-d329-416d-a6c1-7f31f6eafe1f" facs="#m-3b3eadd0-72a5-4459-aac1-cd3b720ddb8a" label="ambiguous">Apoc. 7. c.</l><l xml:id="m-91ce96c7-fdbe-41f2-8ae5-3769789ff837" facs="#m-e43819e7-14d4-4793-915b-32c78b71bea6" label="ambiguous">DOst haec vidi turbam magnam, stantes ante thronum Dei, in con¬</l><l xml:id="m-dff676c3-c653-40c5-b437-e3ab97d664a7" facs="#m-3d91d721-fcd5-411d-9cca-488e6029d5fb" label="lyrics-like">Lquam dinumeráre nemo póte¬</l><l xml:id="m-f038443d-46f6-47e8-a3d8-807006918e4e" facs="#m-586954fc-48d2-4815-a37b-beed49ccbfcb" label="lyrics-like">spéctu Agni, amícti stolis albis,</l><l xml:id="m-62b0a8d3-12d2-4d17-84c7-687f08398bfb" facs="#m-dc1aa870-c3ec-42b6-a794-9e2de2554da2" label="lyrics-like">rat, 1 ex ómnibus géntibus, et et palmae in mánibus eórum.</l><l xml:id="m-13e77e08-1bb7-4d23-a4f3-7fba79df9ee9" facs="#m-d3b9c7ba-bd92-4119-a7fc-e374b5584073" label="lyrics-like">tribubus, et pópulis, et linguis,</l><l xml:id="m-ffa9b303-a600-43f4-90b9-4a466e1abd66" facs="#m-bd0245f4-20b4-4af6-9cdd-d04b671a81f0" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Exsúltent jústi. p. 1155. V. Jústi autem.</l><l xml:id="m-586bfcf0-3226-405c-ab1e-721ada80d234" facs="#m-0962b30c-035e-4939-866b-d1802c51d3fc" label="text-like">AT NONE</l><l xml:id="m-5dc53c3c-8982-4a67-a571-157ebc1b2118" facs="#m-8b76b56f-e91a-46cb-9fd6-099fa896bb55" label="ambiguous">Ant. Hymnus. p. 1729.</l><l xml:id="m-cbb2c59f-e472-4e39-b7b0-a2efd8b28193" facs="#m-cafe9d4e-51d0-4181-a36b-b735f9dba11c" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-f01ead7b-2445-4e96-86c8-3eed841d6513" facs="#m-a7e63288-9ce5-4f5c-9d16-9153b82dd2b7" label="ambiguous">Apoc. 7. c.</l><l xml:id="m-e359f0d8-922e-4bf5-b3dd-f4a93aaa1e00" facs="#m-e5e7b454-1fc1-4027-9576-1ecc49b578b2" label="lyrics-like">Enedíctio, et cláritas, et sapién-] nor, virtus, et fortitúdo Deo no¬</l><l xml:id="m-6fcb46ff-481e-41ec-8e8d-31298e85d7f2" facs="#m-e688c55a-41c8-481b-ba15-c5af060c4534" label="lyrics-like">D tia, et gratiárum áctio, t ho¬l stro, zin saécula saeculórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-5f4266c5-f5f9-4b47-8195-74d45176e8d6" facs="#m-559dc648-deda-4eb6-b6c0-87383b304fe5" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Jústi autem. p. 1155. V. Exsultábunt.</l><l xml:id="m-1b5ea22d-d0ee-4fd4-98f7-b3884d2bf565" facs="#m-f54267e8-b796-44bd-84f6-e5e8fbe57a01" label="text-like">AT SECOND VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-cd3605b3-1456-4ae7-a9e4-e9deedf6dd08" facs="#m-8feca1a4-470e-422d-a441-25cf98057371" label="lyrics-like">Psalms. 1. Díxit Dóminus. I. f. p. 128. — 2. Confitébor. 1. f. p. 133.</l><l xml:id="m-79303d55-0561-4824-bcc6-67a0f5a0638d" facs="#m-98ca1402-e203-4455-83cd-5a0921dd4137" label="lyrics-like">— 3. Beátus vir. 8. G. p. 147. — 4. Laudáte púeri. 8. G. p. 152. —</l><l xml:id="m-eb2a5d27-ad61-49c8-aa86-44670e6088e1" facs="#m-8705fa84-042c-4771-abf7-ccd67dfb03f7" label="lyrics-like">5. Crédidi. 8. G. p. 165.</l><l xml:id="m-ea6cd298-8d54-43de-81d3-516140d10a06" facs="#m-a0f54d4c-aaaf-404a-91b7-f95edf6214d4" label="ambiguous">1.Ant.8</l><l xml:id="m-62e8deeb-fe07-42a9-ae23-3dfce1fb4163" facs="#m-ffe36c32-8cf8-4a56-b42a-715b3a31b750" label="ambiguous">1.1</l><l xml:id="m-3d697c11-f294-4b80-b935-c1a4e4b0a3bf" facs="#m-56eaa075-46d0-4bf7-bd78-bc30c33f1417" label="lyrics-like">I-di túrbam mágnam, * quam dinume-rá-re némo</l><l xml:id="m-c77fe5f1-b305-47f3-bae1-0180b70d768a" facs="#m-cc51bdb0-135e-43fb-9435-31d86a4f6a91" label="lyrics-like">pót-e-rat,</l><l xml:id="m-f855ea18-7405-4fc8-8fa9-c70cde7325c1" facs="#m-3d943a96-1444-46b5-993e-0e0976a696a0" label="lyrics-like">ex ómnibus géntibus, stántes ante thró-num.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
